      }
    },
    "Sudoku boards: %lld · Letter groups: %lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld papan Sudoku · %lld kelompok huruf"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Swipe the board or use the direction buttons. Matching tiles merge once per move. After each valid move, a new tile appears. Earn points by merging tiles. Undo reverses a swipe and the new tile it spawned. Reaching 2048 doesn’t end the game: keep playing until no valid moves remain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Geser papan atau gunakan tombol arah. Angka yang sama bergabung sekali per langkah. Sesudah gerakan sah, muncul satu ubin baru. Skor berasal dari penggabungan. Undo mengembalikan satu geseran beserta undian ubin. Mencapai 2048 bukan akhir permainan: terus bermain sampai tidak ada gerakan sah."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Swipe the board, tap the direction buttons, or use the arrow keys.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Geser papan, tombol arah, atau tombol panah keyboard."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap a card, then its destination column or foundation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap kartu, lalu kolom atau fondasi tujuan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap a face-up card, then its destination column or foundation. Build tableau columns in descending order, alternating colors. You can move a face-up sequence together. Only a king can fill an empty column. Build each suit’s foundation from ace to king. Draw one card at a time from the stock and recycle it as often as needed. Undo reverses one complete action. Complete all four foundations to win.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap kartu terbuka, lalu tap kolom atau fondasi tujuan. Tableau berurutan turun dengan warna bergantian; rangkaian terbuka dapat dipindah bersama. Hanya King mengisi kolom kosong. Fondasi per jenis dimulai dari Ace sampai King. Ambil satu kartu dari stock; putar ulang tanpa batas ketika habis. Undo mengembalikan satu tindakan lengkap. Selesaikan keempat fondasi untuk Menang."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap a revealed number to open its neighbors.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap angka terbuka untuk buka-serentak."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap letters to build an Indonesian word. Tap an answer slot to remove its letter. Submit when all slots are full. Any word in the game’s dictionary that uses every letter counts, including other valid anagrams. Edit your answer if it isn’t accepted. Solve one word to win.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap huruf untuk menyusun jawaban. Tap slot jawaban untuk mengeluarkan hurufnya. Kirim setelah semua slot terisi. Setiap kata dalam korpus yang memakai seluruh huruf diterima, termasuk anagram lain yang sah. Jawaban salah dapat diedit. Satu kata selesai berarti satu Sesi Menang."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap to reveal a cell. Your first cell and its neighbors are safe. Numbers show how many mines are nearby. Use Flag Mode on covered cells. Tap a revealed number to open adjacent cells when it has the same number of neighboring flags. Incorrect flags can expose a mine. Reveal all safe cells to win. Scroll to reach cells that don’t fit on screen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap untuk membuka petak. Pembukaan pertama dan tetangganya aman. Angka menunjukkan jumlah ranjau di sekitarnya. Gunakan mode Bendera pada petak tertutup. Tap angka terbuka untuk membuka tetangga ketika jumlah benderanya cocok; bendera yang salah bisa membuka ranjau. Menang ketika semua petak aman terbuka. Papan dapat digeser untuk menjangkau seluruh petak."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That move isn’t allowed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Langkah belum dapat dilakukan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The save file uses version %lld, which this app doesn’t support.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Simpanan memakai versi %lld yang belum didukung app ini."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This session will be marked as abandoned. Your current board progress will be lost.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sesi ini akan dicatat sebagai Ditinggalkan. Progres papan saat ini tidak dipulihkan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try Again": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Coba Lagi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
